Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.60,0:00:06.00,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,No way, not to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:10.91,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,{\fs23.7}I hope you got it now. That thing called "the difference in league."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.91,0:00:15.21,Serifa Std,,0,0,2,,{\fs22.5}Is he really the strongest?\NHe’s just as strong as the Flame Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.21,0:00:18.75,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,{\fs27}He must've had a pretty easy life up until now, hasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.75,0:00:19.75,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,What did you say!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.75,0:00:21.32,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Oh, you still want more?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.32,0:00:25.62,Serifa Std,,0,0,2,,{\fs22.5}Come on, brother. It's uncool.\NPicking on the weak like that.
